#: scenario3:scenario3_B371B5B2_5FFF_454D_BA8B_595B70E93E11
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 4acf45cf3d087d032582bf40f88d59db1159a5fa4fc2cfd1ede20088e535db7e
#. default-sha256: 5453f576802fbb3fe57494532ab425bb07c8e39426eaf3c520e039a8ded1e94c
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_B371B5B2_5FFF_454D_BA8B_595B70E93E11"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫Though she looked outwardly uncertain as Maria led her "
"forward, hand around her wrist, the White-Haired Girl seemed to be enjoying herself on the inside."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫Embora aparentasse incerteza enquanto Maria a conduzia com a "
"mão em seu pulso, a Garota de Cabelos Brancos parecia estar se divertindo por dentro."

#: scenario3:scenario3_96C33220_D592_454A_B65F_D0C71ABE015E
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 2075e2b3c7e2e1079ff7282dc6820d72c427dfe3c567f167c5fc9dfb2362495c
#. default-sha256: dc67e5d2d48dd2e06f7e68e9507738c3d2cd719019cad768cccc1663c816b12c
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_96C33220_D592_454A_B65F_D0C71ABE015E"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Having spent her life without a single friend, she never dreamed the day would come when she "
"would find herself being dragged through the empty halls of a dark mansion by another woman."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Tendo passado sua vida sem um único amigo, ela nunca sonhou que chegaria o dia em que seria "
"arrastada pelos corredores vazios de uma mansão escura por outra mulher."

#: scenario3:scenario3_B03D2EAA_4E14_4CB5_A9AA_4080EB6B8B87
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 3c1b1e48ac57726de32d6bbc6e816015ec1416a45f7d450e4d473b174c68ef21
#. default-sha256: d3e52674553fa45c2d2378c1937a0372c0e69e6a8865d92511af5f87b6553047
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_B03D2EAA_4E14_4CB5_A9AA_4080EB6B8B87"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Maria’s presence seemed to shine a light upon the quiet corridor;⟪k:1⟫it would have been a "
"very lonely trek without her."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫A presença de Maria parecia iluminar o corredor em silêncio;⟪k:1⟫teria sido uma jornada "
"muito solitária sem ela."

#: scenario3:scenario3_6B22A098_BBF3_42B9_A51D_965983BC3276
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: f9bbb8532da54f9e5cabf46efd81558b1cd9eae42ba81926ca66aac5a183e27e
#. default-sha256: 49694029c118c18ab9192cf3f55a222215cf0b09bb9b5eba1cd0c4f92d5d8054
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_6B22A098_BBF3_42B9_A51D_965983BC3276"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Maria spun around, gave an impish smirk, and raised her pointer finger to her lips with a "
"soft “shhh.”"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Maria se virou, deu um sorriso travesso e levou o dedo indicador aos lábios com um suave "
"“shhh”."

#: scenario3:scenario3_D018C8FF_1783_4D5F_8135_D36CFD201481
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: ee8ef6542ebf2dcea23d5816ed975a3d89e0de74b68a790d257cb404aa3273be
#. default-sha256: 4a7476340a31630dc328b83f8c75bd02c91fedc1c579062fcbb2b2d4189a5548
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_D018C8FF_1783_4D5F_8135_D36CFD201481"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫The sight of it caused the White-Haired Girl to chuckle quietly.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫The two of them, "
"on their way to their secret, private ball,⟪k:3⟫were like two adolescent girls."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫A visão fez com que a Garota de Cabelos Brancos risse baixinho.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫As duas, a caminho "
"de seu privado baile secreto,⟪k:3⟫eram como duas adolescentes."

#: scenario3:scenario3_0A3870C9_338F_40B0_B7B4_6D14C7AB1CDF
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 8c859effbdee32bbeb62002e821b46446470767e320720d7ffdf85d249ed086c
#. default-sha256: e9df8d38021123e5fb23e237f8018c1f65300b788911f943f71c8aa2ad0f549e
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_0A3870C9_338F_40B0_B7B4_6D14C7AB1CDF"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫In short order, they arrived at the great hall."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Em pouco tempo, elas chegaram ao grande salão."

#: scenario3:scenario3_9F571970_3E45_4B4A_8C72_011F9E50A799
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 37364eaa9660e9621419c562a64f982b7bab14f0e6ba504aefa7fbf67d787aa2
#. default-sha256: a4ffebc48b3df0fac4f85b77c16e24e36ad9ee28aeb0b859e8828ca5d72dc354
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_9F571970_3E45_4B4A_8C72_011F9E50A799"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫M-⟪k:10⟫My heart was pounding all the way "
"here..."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫M-⟪k:10⟫Meu coração estava pulando no caminho "
"todo até aqui..."

#: scenario3:scenario3_A3B0773F_61EB_42F7_9458_F05D7EADD71A
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 7e734d7760a37a59ebd16804e4c85dbdd9afc36e7343d37112102f971a63a78f
#. default-sha256: eeeadbf39f26b24f466f1284cde7d9967f59d2ff823709d9f6ac5eea9be12f22
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_A3B0773F_61EB_42F7_9458_F05D7EADD71A"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫What’s there to be nervous about?⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫It’s not like you’re breaking any rules."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫O que há para ficar nervosa?⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Não é como se você estivesse quebrando nenhuma "
"regra."

#: scenario3:scenario3_98B25F09_107D_47E3_9B12_B1FACF315A9D
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: c95052eb746162170ba7059b17ef72a4122bf02ed18b16000f850616bb9beb55
#. default-sha256: 50d98de07d9e3c5c1eb32ca05198807f73e50fe4acc66aef5a2e22c77e5b102d
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_98B25F09_107D_47E3_9B12_B1FACF315A9D"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Only kids get in trouble for staying up late!⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Once you’ve grown up, you’re "
"responsible for yourself."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Só as crianças se metem em encrenca por ficarem acordadas até tarde!⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Uma vez "
"que cresce, você é responsável por si mesma."

#: scenario3:scenario3_74A56512_FC2F_438D_AC68_12043F3BEE23
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 21075109270fc6e51953b81d9d739f5cebea9c219d30d9e5bbe131cf3e0eb6c6
#. default-sha256: 855787de04dacb6b76562cee841d35b4ea2335e2a344052336183fa36d9f0fd1
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_74A56512_FC2F_438D_AC68_12043F3BEE23"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Hehe..."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Hehe..."

#: scenario3:scenario3_5630319A_E42E_4BB9_993C_8890EEE2E419
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 5de7bedd4941934494c2885c643a550442751e0a526c7692b875eddad76317ae
#. default-sha256: 5b35a1b643a09ca3e9d40e6b2b976cab724546d1836f1d676d7cdd47de31446e
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_5630319A_E42E_4BB9_993C_8890EEE2E419"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫I will say, though, that it seems rather odd for two women to dance together."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Direi, porém, que parece bastante estranho duas mulheres dançarem juntas."

#: scenario3:scenario3_22E7B308_3F8A_43FB_909B_4BF232C2BBBD
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 4e2257d791e3878c20070c60d5ed0a24e8e8757713f264009c02cba926e86e65
#. default-sha256: d99501c8e7d9b5b98b15ec8bb72658d08cbf0ba18bc70950e95b7681d13efd64
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_22E7B308_3F8A_43FB_909B_4BF232C2BBBD"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Oh? If you’re having a good time, what does it matter what’s between your legs? ⟪k:2⟫"
"Where I come from, there’re dances where families lock arms in a big ring and go ’round in "
"circles."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Ah? Se você está se divertindo, o que importa o que tem entre suas pernas? ⟪k:2⟫De onde "
"eu venho, há danças em que as famílias dão as mãos e formam uma grande roda, dançando em círculos."

#: scenario3:scenario3_91608649_B4C7_49DA_B8D6_C1D554538A62
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 2c190daafc7946a800fdf42946b54e18de24cc00d4da55b8acad4938754eb2cb
#. default-sha256: 4f5f693087434f39148f90a5e4931ee6fa431997acdb9a4dc19cdce6bfca0833
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_91608649_B4C7_49DA_B8D6_C1D554538A62"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫So who says two girls can’t have some fun together?!"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Então, quem disse que duas garotas não podem se divertir juntas?!"

#: scenario3:scenario3_74DC1BB5_F7FE_4D6D_896C_47F8BA040F7E
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: f03c9792fe95bb1533537aeeec4c1f02007c363c64af3186dd8287395d659266
#. default-sha256: 2b37a9465db9ac4079fee23b8ad76d609067d6d73205e9fe4fb1a7a6072ace7c
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_74DC1BB5_F7FE_4D6D_896C_47F8BA040F7E"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫I imagine you had many good moments with your family."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Imagino que você tenha tido muitos bons momentos com sua família."

#: scenario3:scenario3_6197179F_2AE7_4FD1_8DC5_4018C1690F18
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 2a10784d426168a320dcc74a18b39054d6c551bd9522836f729b1645c328811f
#. default-sha256: 0b47474f99e243951be66af8b21c17e4ec5f633cac06cfb5e5c7b37a312d9562
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_6197179F_2AE7_4FD1_8DC5_4018C1690F18"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Well... ⟪k:2⟫I don’t have a family anymore."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Bem... ⟪k:2⟫eu não tenho uma família mais."

#: scenario3:scenario3_AD32D160_72C6_48A8_B74D_40637F3D35C2
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 7d5e4c50112b811aa8564362e364a40c6372340868e28ffba87aaa140d1e84c9
#. default-sha256: d1e675f01b7d7efaadf41d49ec62124e48313f5716b01fcedc108d03f9da3e9b
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_AD32D160_72C6_48A8_B74D_40637F3D35C2"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫What...?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫O que...?"

#: scenario3:scenario3_5DA78352_6D4A_40CD_A473_4534DF9A8168
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 8909e44a52e50da20c1a3df2b021695cdd010b482ebaae2c6f1a01a76c16d6b1
#. default-sha256: f6ad8f841fb93d3a907e0b15af8f119fc934eaad46a6c4aee1aee002a51757ae
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_5DA78352_6D4A_40CD_A473_4534DF9A8168"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫All right, so I’ll show you how it’s done.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Watch carefully, ’cause you’re up "
"next!"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Tudo bem, então eu vou te mostrar como se faz.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Assista com atenção, porque "
"você é a próxima!"

#: scenario3:scenario3_4DD16ADC_4FB9_4721_8CF2_8988C5C4C967
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: aff960f5a686d81a0006cdeb2bc142b02b491a72ffb82a452db787bc509aa213
#. default-sha256: cac91f1321e65fc79e47ebd37d8f14e92f865937b34534fa7b63040d7b313179
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_4DD16ADC_4FB9_4721_8CF2_8988C5C4C967"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Ah... ⟪k:2⟫o-⟪k:3⟫okay."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Ah... ⟪k:2⟫t-⟪k:3⟫tá bem."

#: scenario3:scenario3_E18EA77E_74A9_4366_B4E6_101505AA7A55
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: cd83e9ccfcee5533e89a573f751175e1e7c9e92557c9d4689913ae0b23f2714a
#. default-sha256: 532f2cc1ab42adc4dec1c6e56de47cc1c4482bc90ee0273fca48c6870abae010
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_E18EA77E_74A9_4366_B4E6_101505AA7A55"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫With a wide grin on her face, Maria began whistling softly and prancing "
"across the floor with an energetic rhythm."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Com um largo sorriso no rosto, Maria começou a assobiar baixinho e a saltitar "
"pelo chão com um ritmo enérgico."

#: scenario3:scenario3_80FCE4CE_1F91_4B28_8EB6_3061F2DDA2CC
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 6baa38da5e8f87f4233118550bcd5592ca08c7a1c442012ed4b522866a0ae160
#. default-sha256: 0b538a3bfae451b028354a9382b2b46bbc32ddf2549b0949d33500c2b02d71bd
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_80FCE4CE_1F91_4B28_8EB6_3061F2DDA2CC"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫It was not the kind of complicated dance you’d see at fancy parties."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Não era o tipo de dança complicada que você veria em festas chiques."

#: scenario3:scenario3_A817D415_E705_47F0_9D5F_AA7C63C87B16
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: d31fec5c5eda2e902e22a298fc977c1227ad83f017ce554b136eea8af585752e
#. default-sha256: e691c512db20ac4bf64096d744145a253bd4de8c199082e4907cb5dea19d65fb
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_A817D415_E705_47F0_9D5F_AA7C63C87B16"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫The motions were simple, flowing, unembellished—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫a folk dance, I suppose you "
"might call it.⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫She seemed to be improvising a little bit as well."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Os movimentos eram simples, fluidos, sem embelezamento—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫uma dança regional, "
"suponho que você possa chamá-la.⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫Ela parecia estar improvisando um pouco também."

#: scenario3:scenario3_BC8F8D24_6B49_44C2_A27C_CD4E18A8D890
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 4920f19eaf028157e28917b52a3bddd4e9d4df8fa112c69c8f2d720e1b214924
#. default-sha256: c47995a2c8589f5615d33c992698f69b42098eb39f216e8159b0e261a6d21af0
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_BC8F8D24_6B49_44C2_A27C_CD4E18A8D890"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫But in any event, the White-Haired Girl was captivated."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Mas de qualquer forma, a Garota de Cabelos Brancos foi cativada."

#: scenario3:scenario3_3350D509_3709_4309_B77D_4BE260D61F59
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 93abff7b913bec7bea58cdd4d8a0615688e9270a8de5329a54681585ce4d6c4f
#. default-sha256: 4216e686c1c49066a513483e0278a04cfa50f2c120479572f2654a32826e2222
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_3350D509_3709_4309_B77D_4BE260D61F59"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Despite it being a sequence of steps anyone could replicate,⟪k:1⟫Maria breathed life into "
"the dance."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Apesar de ser uma sequência de passos que qualquer um poderia replicar,⟪k:1⟫Maria deu vida à "
"dança."

#: scenario3:scenario3_AC32B8C2_19F3_40EC_84F6_5567F5E9D0C1
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: fbdf7eb359acd86e6f267bd7c7175d234951af630c4d38129be735306a26abca
#. default-sha256: 654224fe3c4361ad7c8a90056735bd597a6df53cb4b899648f9d788e74d38602
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_AC32B8C2_19F3_40EC_84F6_5567F5E9D0C1"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫She was neither as lithe as an acrobat nor as light on her feet as a professional dancer."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Ela não era tão ágil quanto um acrobata nem tão leve quanto uma dançarina profissional."

#: scenario3:scenario3_478B7A2B_1580_4F75_97B3_84FF6131E8F0
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 68cb484d461600752fa6a6425aa276f94bda7929c191608d5aabcea5da991f21
#. default-sha256: efdf3541ad7d667851481e4f54b0331db76672e92e3f84968c0aaa576f7b33e0
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_478B7A2B_1580_4F75_97B3_84FF6131E8F0"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫She was her own, lively, beautiful self."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Era ela mesma, vivida e bonita."

#: scenario3:scenario3_FA632136_9FDF_4C20_90D0_C3102E2C1DA1
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: b341d5f9b74f3769df98241fcf9bee19c8d3de619c1195bb0363af98ba57d548
#. default-sha256: 975940027ca2d9cfacd5b2e5a2190106efe66c8bd67869a3638aef7f74bb0206
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_FA632136_9FDF_4C20_90D0_C3102E2C1DA1"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Maria twirled in place, the skirt of her maid uniform billowing gently up around her. ⟪k:1⟫"
"With a smile, she extended her hand toward the White-Haired Girl."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Maria girou no lugar, a saia de seu uniforme de criada esvoaçando suavemente ao redor dela. "
"⟪k:1⟫Com um sorriso, ela estendeu a mão para a Garota de Cabelos Brancos."

#: scenario3:scenario3_36EB736A_E234_4CDF_B995_8753F0AC28D6
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 5871d248ca481299fca5a19a31ad95172dab9da9185db12962cb72c51c644399
#. default-sha256: 084ace12a1004ec5c9b4e1755989e4942e542d1d47235bb342697d2225f3452d
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_36EB736A_E234_4CDF_B995_8753F0AC28D6"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫She hesitated for a moment, but as if being pulled forward by some invisible force, she took "
"Maria’s hand."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Ela hesitou por um momento, mas como se estivesse sendo puxada por alguma força invisível, "
"pegou na mão de Maria."

#: scenario3:scenario3_DCB77764_09BF_4F75_8804_A291D11383B4
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 75aeb846a3092405c5f6ec97308d09e7460b67c70d6a04cce9cd0918d96eb488
#. default-sha256: f099d859840a15056222f9e92c1be4f4da11a2cce0a037cd6a1e0aa2ad847d03
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_DCB77764_09BF_4F75_8804_A291D11383B4"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Hand-in-hand, Maria ushered the White-Haired Girl into her dance."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫De mãos dadas, Maria introduziu a Garota de Cabelos Brancos em sua dança."

#: scenario3:scenario3_00E49622_54AE_41C1_A6DF_4391101C0ED5
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: f0a973d699839f69d0883d1ccf36c249b9361cd7400815e80c4d44b14c6df55d
#. default-sha256: a8996e7bee85a49e29bb03cc2888932dc2ead2ab0afa6030be08cfa97328d833
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_00E49622_54AE_41C1_A6DF_4391101C0ED5"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫It was just the two of them, but you could almost see the crowd forming around them..."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Eram apenas as duas, mas quase dava para ver a multidão se formando ao redor delas..."

#: scenario3:scenario3_311AD7AE_688C_4BEA_97FF_A0B2E3E315FB
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 02d689b61f01279baf94040de67f508b8bfc903e21bea42a580ba523840546ec
#. default-sha256: 6dda16e9f57f4415a0c8f6be9132cb0b2bc6412dd5b91e8604d69341975c918d
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_311AD7AE_688C_4BEA_97FF_A0B2E3E315FB"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫the other people stepping up to join in."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫as outras pessoas se aproximando para participar."

#: scenario3:scenario3_153FE6BB_4F57_4B7C_BC7B_A0991FD49AAD
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 06bdd875abca31ee27dbfaadac679b404cb6127ace699a501b0296659ff91bed
#. default-sha256: 57a3b81d0020ff712f3c30ddc2f636be37ad86231ba429935a991ad5aa073244
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_153FE6BB_4F57_4B7C_BC7B_A0991FD49AAD"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫That’s it, Madam. Doin’ great!⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Now lift your leg up, good, and spin like so."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫É isso, Madame. Está indo bem!⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Agora levante a perna, bom, e gire assim."

#: scenario3:scenario3_3DBBD0C0_88C4_4183_907D_F8AD8A80B9FC
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 5e20e513e91281cabcba0596c42ed8ada4479cb2490167c8634f95fe84c263a2
#. default-sha256: 8589c2574a07977f1934f0fac5b1b640d5e1fc14e9ebe637b393a9dc05b5e08e
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_3DBBD0C0_88C4_4183_907D_F8AD8A80B9FC"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Th-⟪k:1⟫This is not easy, Maria.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫I’m having trouble following along..."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫I-⟪k:1⟫Isso não é fácil, Maria.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Estou com dificuldade de acompanhar..."

#: scenario3:scenario3_ABA7A7A3_2BD1_45C2_AE14_9D976B6B00F0
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: d6e6d35f06978b7fc9f069a976beca79a097c97d97f17039f85f014aa9cef150
#. default-sha256: fe0fcc6d60d17a4be6266a589b700190e94ce038c7197c02159e6e6077a849da
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_ABA7A7A3_2BD1_45C2_AE14_9D976B6B00F0"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫You can do it!⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Looking good so far!⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫You’re a natural, Madam!"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Você consegue!⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Até agora vai bem!⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫Você aprende rápido, Madame!"

#: scenario3:scenario3_74103C2E_D0CD_4425_B338_E3C4B8B15E5D
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: d8694d0604f68f0879d46a58d41ecd9f761a0937f63dc97f877f6dc0bf043a6c
#. default-sha256: daf20675531bbe3ecec48c57c9d2383dcefec504e9bfd1fd2934b35482ed6c84
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_74103C2E_D0CD_4425_B338_E3C4B8B15E5D"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Oh, Maria...⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫I won’t fall for your flattery."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Ah, Maria...⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Não vou cair na sua bajulação."

#: scenario3:scenario3_595B9CE1_E64A_4CC0_A787_63066803C4CD
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: a46ee1739a212c8eb2d68c9e2b26221fda825ef6f73b205ea3e7009e1506bd04
#. default-sha256: 53a1bb20908bcc17a5e50b30cdcbccdcb64301b68598d74bef7065a57164f55e
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_595B9CE1_E64A_4CC0_A787_63066803C4CD"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫I mean it."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Falo sério."

#: scenario3:scenario3_AF5831BE_12C1_44B1_98B0_CDC9025A6FA1
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 084c8d6041f3c32c78fcfff5256ab63b3eb89aa0f0758cd137feccc4e2430537
#. default-sha256: 884973119819306a78a3ef1c903ec4f5733777081849235140699ad70779cb9f
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_AF5831BE_12C1_44B1_98B0_CDC9025A6FA1"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫The whispers of the two girls.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Their muffled laughs.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫Step, hop, step, step."
"⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫The rustling of fabric."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Os sussurros das duas garotas.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Suas risadas abafadas.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫Passo, salto, passo, "
"passo.⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫O farfalhar do tecido."

#: scenario3:scenario3_72879ED8_1640_418B_8308_591CED4EF744
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 282a609ceee93d2efe47ab5dd03b0ba7bcd12ad03c14c3bd333fce5d84eeeebe
#. default-sha256: 6ca57c870cda269bb8099982538a3f90ae9cd369b0dbc6a9bb711494b662b37a
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_72879ED8_1640_418B_8308_591CED4EF744"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Many different soft sounds layered atop one another, creating a little bubble of happiness "
"in the center of the hall."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Muitos sons suaves diferentes se sobrepuseram, criando uma pequena bolha de felicidade no "
"centro do salão."

#: scenario3:scenario3_EE39CF84_5DCB_47C7_A6A2_5F1C6AB3E8F0
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 9e3a8b00a78996d696c1d716043d9cdca3dc56c61c2a613bab170a4382d0cb43
#. default-sha256: d2a60b68a7c1164b4f0157d3bbd5062663086266e75a37f03ff21b926fc93d42
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_EE39CF84_5DCB_47C7_A6A2_5F1C6AB3E8F0"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫The White-Haired Girl’s movements were a great deal clumsier than Maria’s, but Maria would "
"never disparage her for that."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Os movimentos da Garota de Cabelos Brancos eram muito mais desajeitados do que os de Maria, "
"mas Maria nunca a depreciaria por isso."

#: scenario3:scenario3_5E4E99D2_C126_495A_BBC6_DD8367B68CD9
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: a2f3245a3de44300b818f0d85ae3923aa2b3d257c32f2cfb3d49123011392cc0
#. default-sha256: 6a70d4a0134bc26cb9e43c7d80778735b8789573bbe07d6b8b3b37b957cc8fb2
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_5E4E99D2_C126_495A_BBC6_DD8367B68CD9"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫On the contrary, she showered her with praise. ⟪k:1⟫As flustered as the White-Haired Girl "
"appeared, I imagine she was quite pleased."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Pelo contrário, ela a cobriu de elogios. ⟪k:1⟫Por mais perturbada que a Garota de Cabelos "
"Brancos parecesse, imagino que ela tenha ficado bastante contente."

#: scenario3:scenario3_F25A50BD_5B57_4304_9AE4_E0B21F00561E
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: bc36776c70ecc9e69662242e993f81df5d536e4ce3a68ac3268106b25725fbe3
#. default-sha256: f865bb4b6853ed6c9ec6601cb517b5e0d7e23eb4f82e2587b8b77c2daee7bc51
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_F25A50BD_5B57_4304_9AE4_E0B21F00561E"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Before long, the tightness in her face muscles loosened, a smile spread across her lips, and "
"she began to brighten up."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Em pouco tempo, a tensão nos músculos de seu rosto se afrouxou, um sorriso se espalhou em "
"seus lábios e ela começou a se animar."

#: scenario3:scenario3_492CA4CA_48E8_4150_946D_F4B39F9B207D
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 306ada62f68882064bd7f38ec29ab18b5ea083196e173f1d72971e5d5f70266a
#. default-sha256: c3812ef93b52a3348852228b7588191d883ec330f9fc5fae61e723c1b660e284
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_492CA4CA_48E8_4150_946D_F4B39F9B207D"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫See?⟪k:1⟫What’d I tell ya?⟪k:2⟫Fun, huh?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Viu?⟪k:1⟫O que eu disse?⟪k:2⟫Divertido, hein?"

#: scenario3:scenario3_EFF7A002_53EC_4B9F_B5AA_580D15A808BC
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: bd2bfdbae4b4fd3b9d46748fdcd788133ae4b6e77ada5f7ea99baf6521ab515b
#. default-sha256: 28149c918c6bf0c0e370ef8844ec56a1e8d79318873f08b5ba9062a561455f48
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_EFF7A002_53EC_4B9F_B5AA_580D15A808BC"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Yes. I am quite surprised—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫both that I ⟪k:4⟫can⟪k:5⟫ dance and that I enjoy "
"doing it so much."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Sim. Estou bastante surpresa—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫que eu ⟪k:4⟫consigo⟪k:5⟫ dançar e que gosto "
"tanto."

#: scenario3:scenario3_2D87F38D_28F3_4B87_8405_FCD8A13C39B6
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 1a38811b279e1e2f6d0b5a824397bd6ae8ab5d98fd63eeb7160008c794973c22
#. default-sha256: ab5c53d33eeddadf83eb61d3034fd1c5033dbc35ccbb0e59157646c4ace9769c
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_2D87F38D_28F3_4B87_8405_FCD8A13C39B6"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Hahah! Glad to hear it!"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Hahah! Fico feliz em ouvir isso!"

#: scenario3:scenario3_C4F380E4_755E_4CE7_BBD6_18E9B3510388
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: b97e7ce06546826689cf4cde030ab86263c37cbf763b25f6409b975400d54841
#. default-sha256: 20dffbfb1b0b165ba0bc34e74f14cb5a570f5615df9256ef03f695dce98e4d72
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_C4F380E4_755E_4CE7_BBD6_18E9B3510388"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫They exchanged looks and both laughed. ⟪k:1⟫That might have been the first time I had ever "
"seen the White-Haired Girl so delighted."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Elas trocaram olhares e ambas riram. ⟪k:1⟫Essa deve ter sido a primeira vez que eu vi a "
"Garota de Cabelos Brancos tão encantada."

#: scenario3:scenario3_9FF8CF68_2DCB_4081_A2D6_4674035B5010
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 7d118a48e7433db59cbdfeee2e80a1f57e4b0b07e8bd8f0ffae39bae3b1a8566
#. default-sha256: 76d5253aed4a3914228e0445befd928c80f3a55a2c5737ab7ff7b2c8e02a0742
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_9FF8CF68_2DCB_4081_A2D6_4674035B5010"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫However, because of her infirmity, she quickly found herself out of breath, her porcelain "
"skin flushed red."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫No entanto, por causa de sua enfermidade, ela rapidamente se viu sem fôlego, sua pele de "
"porcelana corando vermelha."

#: scenario3:scenario3_A176BBA4_5C5B_4D0C_87E1_CAE5C1779EB4
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 77c1c2d1bc8c95d34d43e697e08f9473af27eef79701e81fe2396253750397d0
#. default-sha256: 95f1a16a51f61c997155f4515f426741b552be1799495bb121cc6dc3e03eeb1c
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_A176BBA4_5C5B_4D0C_87E1_CAE5C1779EB4"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Maria immediately stopped for a break."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Maria parou imediatamente para uma pausa."

#: scenario3:scenario3_CBBB1F31_D4FC_46C4_9F32_5D62A4853939
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: da9a50e98f40d9d4c44094d40e23d4f038c750aa842fef3460228d3bd77bed64
#. default-sha256: 1386ddd789c63fb2b497f97d04718956641a6bed0e56250720e1d28c65c1fd64
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_CBBB1F31_D4FC_46C4_9F32_5D62A4853939"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫She could surely have continued dancing for some time yet, but Maria was conscientious of "
"the White-Haired Girl’s physical condition."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Certamente poderia ter continuado dançando por algum tempo ainda, mas Maria estava "
"consciente da condição física da Garota de Cabelos Brancos."

#: scenario3:scenario3_4BD5B9AC_1407_4118_9077_28D9615E3102
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 29b53fa68a1f70d539fba675244725617cca70a2d1a6b05920af68934b4aa254
#. default-sha256: a2518f70c09d0ed3b0a08d043c35fb40b76bd40c9d2de0e6511b90f93e3a2bf6
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_4BD5B9AC_1407_4118_9077_28D9615E3102"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫She looked over at Maria regretfully."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Ela olhou para Maria com pesar."

#: scenario3:scenario3_AA806ABD_A17D_4C0B_B0DC_407908E135F7
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 1defc1188936b53cd768c14b39ab3de73d8ebc892c90d8f74551e22c4b4b7e1d
#. default-sha256: 760996f8a454df55294d0f18ac0150965e6b7447550fc05a4e3c73ccd8788cfc
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_AA806ABD_A17D_4C0B_B0DC_407908E135F7"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫My apologies. If only I had more stamina...⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫I am "
"hardly a suitable partner for you, Maria."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫Me desculpe. Se ao menos eu tivesse mais resistência..."
"⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫Dificilmente sou uma parceira adequada para você, Maria."

#: scenario3:scenario3_6A6F6A03_1B55_4CCC_BC45_D93B45B6135C
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 50ed47b23a572b8fcaf8f28a3c711fb16dbef56da5a9bf3633d8d8ad58775203
#. default-sha256: 8f7fae11df3e01ea1d190040c10bda738c7903ec0da63429673cf23e6c29f436
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_6A6F6A03_1B55_4CCC_BC45_D93B45B6135C"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Sure you are! ⟪k:2⟫This is all to cheer you up, Madam,⟪k:3⟫so as long as you’re having "
"fun, nothing else matters!"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Com certeza você é! ⟪k:2⟫Tudo isto é para animá-la, Madame,⟪k:3⟫então contanto que você "
"esteja se divertindo, nada mais importa!"

#: scenario3:scenario3_016A6001_C3DB_41FA_86C0_32021741B8A3
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 8374342039a0e979c2462eb598bec66af9e787558dfe2a0a04a26be1863d49c8
#. default-sha256: e3609974aefd4771112851bbad138e727eae71f9e42216b58308235c56347a23
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_016A6001_C3DB_41FA_86C0_32021741B8A3"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫And heck, I’m enjoying myself plenty too.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Whaddya think, wouldn’t it be nice to do "
"this again sometime?"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫E caramba, estou me divertindo bastante também.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫O que você acha, não seria bom "
"fazer isso de novo algum dia?"

#: scenario3:scenario3_F218979F_B579_49C7_9FF9_A2F50ED63BA4
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 30270e0d0e263240b8e199bbdf0e0191b782ee22148ff194749901d29ce1c9ba
#. default-sha256: 05c658c61b0ad400a1f5b79e506aa32c9021cc40f99fb7250784a5dc1a09e857
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_F218979F_B579_49C7_9FF9_A2F50ED63BA4"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Whenever you’re feeling down, let’s dance."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Sempre que você estiver se sentindo para baixo, vamos dançar."

#: scenario3:scenario3_A51D2C92_2001_4BA7_9EDD_D985CF66B96A
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: c9a1d72f90721d52ece42e8275f1b3d8aabf2d4d6c9f778973a38e823a714a06
#. default-sha256: cbe568a9d2ccd6fc2b224c70637a1d7e60c9da8cf180e9364f5dc586cfbeca57
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_A51D2C92_2001_4BA7_9EDD_D985CF66B96A"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫If you... ⟪k:2⟫If you really do enjoy...⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫dancing with a frail girl like me, "
"then I would be glad to..."
msgstr ""
